@crew moleth
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Moleth: eager, formal, all questions.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Greetings! May I ask a question? Why do you all say "cheers"? Is something being cheered?   #funny
- Good day. You work in Works? Then you know the engine room. May I see it? Please?
? tier>=acquaintance
- Ah, {me}! I have four new questions. And three old ones you did not finish.   #funny
== feel
? mood:high
- Chief Calder answered question nineteen. I have twenty-one to go.   #funny
? mood:low
- Nobody would tell me what the blue crate is for. I will find out.
== near
? deck:5
- Your Works bay! Every tool has a shadow on the wall. Who decides the shadows?
? deck:3 act:meal
- Your people eat three times a day, together, talking. It is very sociable. And loud.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I study Concord ships. Yours is my favourite so far. It hums when it is happy.   #warm
